      "description": "Listen to your Apple Music collection through an interface inspired by the classic music players of the past - but with much, much more under the hood.  While IvyPod features advanced, fine-tuned lighting and haptics to create the illusion of actually holding a dedicated music player, it also contains features that would have never been possible in the past - without compromising simplicity and functionality.\n\nFeatures:\n- A wheel-based Apple Music player with simple navigation menus\n- A Genie lamp that can identify music played around you (powered by Shazam)\n- An immersive rotary-style search wheel\n- A Clock-based Weather app\n- A wheel-based Camera and Photo Booth\n- View your Activity Rings in a carrousel\n- Mini games that react to your music library - choices in-game affect music playback.\n- Rubber-band-like scrolling and reactivity with many choices of sounds\n- Flashlight, Timer, Stopwatch, World Clocks, and Alarms\n- Create Apple Music stations based on any song in your library\n- Build playlists by assigning and rating your music collection from 1-5 stars\n- View your photos and listen to your downloaded podcasts\n- Screen filters and sleek animations\n- Color theming and view options; modernize your experience or stick with simplicity\n- Late-night color and brightness modes to reduce eye stain\n- Automatic brightness controls which adapt the UI to the time of day.\n\nThis app also contains:\n-NO subscriptions\n-NO in-app purchases\n-NO advertisements\n-NO data-collection (opt-in to share diagnostic data to help fix bugs)\n\nIt is a pay-once, premium experience designed to bring joy to you and your Apple Music collection.  Enjoy free updates with new features and abilities.",
